---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBanner from '../../components/CtaBanner.astro';

const lang = 'en' as const;
---

<BaseLayout
  lang={lang}
  title="Our Services | Ezra Maroc"
  description="Discover Ezra Maroc's dedicated services for obtaining Moroccan nationality: eligibility assessment, file compilation, administrative follow-up, and more."
  currentPage="services"
  pageCSS={['services']}
>
  <main id="main-content" class="page-banner">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Our Dedicated Services</h1>
      <p>Simplify your journey to Moroccan citizenship. Ezra Maroc transforms administrative complexity into a serene and successful process, reconnecting you to your heritage.</p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <section class="section services-intro">
    <div class="container">
      <p>
        Reconnecting with your Moroccan roots through nationality is a powerful project, but administrative procedures can often seem daunting.
      </p>
      <p>
        At Ezra Maroc, we fully understand these challenges. That's why we've designed a <strong>comprehensive and integrated range of services</strong>, led by <strong>dedicated experts</strong>. Our mission: to transform administrative complexity into a <strong>clear, controlled, and serene journey</strong> for you.
      </p>
      <p>
        Let us handle the technical and administrative aspects, so you can focus on what matters most: your reconnection with Morocco. Discover below how we <strong>guide you towards success</strong>, step by step.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="eligibility" class="section service-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="service-content">
          <h2 class="service-title">Strategic Eligibility Assessment</h2>
          <div class="service-blocks">
            <div class="service-block">
              <h3 class="block-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-check-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i> What we do</h3>
              <ul class="service-list">
                <li><strong>In-depth analysis</strong> of your family situation and ties to Morocco</li>
                <li><strong>Preliminary review</strong> of the documents you possess</li>
                <li><strong>Personalized interview</strong> to understand your family history</li>
                <li><strong>Targeted genealogical research</strong> if necessary</li>
                <li><strong>Expert evaluation</strong> of your application's chances of success</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="service-block benefit-block">
              <h3 class="block-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-gift" aria-hidden="true"></i> Your clear benefit</h3>
              <p>Receive a <strong>frank and precise analysis</strong> of your eligibility. <strong>Decide confidently</strong> whether to proceed or not, *before* committing time and expense.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="constitution" class="section service-section alt-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-folder-open" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="service-content">
          <h2 class="service-title">Rigorous File Compilation</h2>
          <div class="service-blocks">
            <div class="service-block">
              <h3 class="block-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-check-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i> What we do</h3>
              <ul class="service-list">
                <li><strong>Precise establishment</strong> of the exhaustive document list for your case</li>
                <li><strong>Proactive assistance</strong> in collecting official documents</li>
                <li><strong>Complete organization</strong> of required sworn translations</li>
                <li><strong>Meticulous management</strong> of legalization and apostille procedures</li>
                <li><strong>Rigorous legal verification</strong> of each document</li>
                <li><strong>Structured preparation</strong> of a file meeting Moroccan requirements</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="service-block benefit-block">
              <h3 class="block-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-gift" aria-hidden="true"></i> Your direct benefit</h3>
              <p>Ensure you submit a <strong>meticulously prepared file</strong> that is <strong>strictly compliant</strong> with authorities' requirements, thereby <strong>maximizing</strong> your chances of swift approval.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="recherche" class="section service-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-tree" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="service-content">
          <h2 class="service-title">In-Depth Genealogical Research</h2>
          <div class="service-blocks">
            <div class="service-block">
              <h3 class="block-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-check-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i> What we do</h3>
              <ul class="service-list">
                <li><strong>Targeted investigation</strong> in civil status archives (Morocco and abroad)</li>
                <li><strong>Analysis of Adoul</strong> and consular registers</li>
                <li><strong>Reconstruction of family lines</strong> to establish lineage</li>
                <li><strong>Search for crucial documents</strong>, old or missing</li>
                <li><strong>Collaboration with local experts</strong> in archival research</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="service-block benefit-block">
              <h3 class="block-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-gift" aria-hidden="true"></i> Your essential proof</h3>
              <p>Find the <strong>crucial documentary evidence</strong>, even old records, to <strong>solidly</strong> establish your line of descent and your ancestors' nationality.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="suivi" class="section service-section alt-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-clipboard-check" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="service-content">
          <h2 class="service-title">Active Administrative Follow-up</h2>
          <div class="service-blocks">
            <div class="service-block">
              <h3 class="block-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-check-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i> What we do</h3>
              <ul class="service-list">
                <li><strong>Optimized submission</strong> of your file to the competent authorities</li>
                <li><strong>Continuous and regular monitoring</strong> of your application's progress</li>
                <li><strong>Targeted interventions</strong> with Moroccan administrations</li>
                <li><strong>Swift handling</strong> of any additional requests</li>
                <li><strong>Transparent communication</strong> on the progress status</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="service-block benefit-block">
              <h3 class="block-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-gift" aria-hidden="true"></i> Your peace of mind</h3>
              <p>Gain <strong>serenity</strong> through proactive monitoring that <strong>streamlines the processing</strong> of your application and keeps you informed of progress in real time.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="post-obtention" class="section service-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-passport" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="service-content">
          <h2 class="service-title">Post-Obtainment Support (Optional)</h2>
          <div class="service-blocks">
            <div class="service-block">
              <h3 class="block-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-check-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i> What we do</h3>
              <ul class="service-list">
                <li><strong>Practical advice</strong> for obtaining your Moroccan identity documents</li>
                <li><strong>Specific assistance</strong> for CNIE-related procedures</li>
                <li><strong>Complete support</strong> for the Moroccan passport application</li>
                <li><strong>Administrative guidance</strong> for post-nationality formalities</li>
                <li><strong>Sound advice</strong> for potentially settling in Morocco</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="service-block benefit-block">
              <h3 class="block-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-gift" aria-hidden="true"></i> Your facilitated integration</h3>
              <p>Finalize your integration as a Moroccan citizen <strong>hassle-free</strong>. We guide you to quickly obtain your <strong>official documents</strong> (CNIE, passport).</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section approach-section-enhanced">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">Our <span>Integrated</span> Approach</h2>
      <div class="approach-content">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-key approach-bg-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <p>Each of our services is part of a <strong>comprehensive, turnkey approach</strong>. We handle all administrative and legal procedures, allowing you to focus serenely on your project of reconnecting with your Moroccan roots.</p>
        <p>Our dedicated team coordinates all stakeholders and steps, ensuring a <strong>smooth, transparent, and stress-free experience</strong>, even in the most complex situations.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="cta-title">Ready to make your Moroccan nationality project a reality?</h2>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="#eligibility" class="btn btn-light">Assess my eligibility</a>
        <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-outline-light">Contact an expert</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CtaBanner lang={lang} />
</BaseLayout>
